Zed's manifest change for patches/0040-apple-accessibility-display.patch, which patch-paths.sh cannot translate.
In Zed, gpui_ios's objc2-ui-kit and gpui_macos's objc2-app-kit features live in the workspace Cargo.toml.
sync-fork.sh translates the patch with --drop-manifests and appends this file's diff
(docs/patch-translation.md). Change it only when the patch's Cargo.toml hunk changes.

